We are looking to engage a Commissioning Manager, who will become the main reference for the Client as to product performance aspects and as to technical aspects related to Pre-commissioning and Commissioning activities.
Also, act as the main corporate reference to planning, systems present in the product, execution sequences, andtechnical aspects related toPre-commissioning and Commissioning.
Responsibilities
Take part, during the Project Execution Plan drafting phase, in the definition of the Project strategy, by becoming the reference as to all the aspects related to Pre-commissioning and Commissioning activities;
Take part in engineering, either developed internally or supplied by the Client, from the very first steps, by liaising with the EM and the Field Engineers as to explanations, changes, and/or optimizations aimed at the definition of increasingly correct commissioning sequences;
Define, together with the EM and SCM, the list of critical supplies for which the COM is required to witness the Factory Acceptance Test;
Define the plan and sequences of commissioning activities, by identifying internal and/or external resources (contracting companies and Vendors’ personnel) and/or assets necessary for the execution of activities in compliance with contractual requirements and with the project plan;
Prepare, together with the EM and PSLs, the Design Documents List of documents related to Commissioning activities, including the definition of the relevant milestones;
Prepare, together with PSLs, subcontract specifications by defining the scope of work of the different subcontractors as to Pre-commissioning and Commissioning activities;
Take part in constructability meetings so as to highlight, from the very first stages of the Project up to the construction phase, the obligations to be fulfilled as to commissioning activities, in order to optimize activities themselves, prevent any operational problems, andfoster a safe execution; said obligations shall be acknowledged starting from the engineering phases;
Arrange, together with the Project Team, the Project overall planning as to every aspect dealing with Pre-commissioning and Commissioning activities;
Prepare the CloseOutReport, with reference toPre-commissioning and Commissioning sections, by cooperating with the PQM and the CM.
Requirements
Bachelor's Degree in relevant Engineering fields.
Minimum of 15+ years of experience and 7+ years of relevant experience in a similar position.
Good Knowledge of main logic and use of the standard Commissioning IT Tools;
Good skills in Microsoft Office Suite.
Fluency in written and spoken English.

